OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA damp start, with rain turning
OL,6,Fto blustery, heavy showers with
OL,7,Fthunder possible. Perhaps a few
OL,8,Fbrighter spells at times in between
OL,9,Fthese. A milder day than yesterday yet
OL,10,Ffeeling unpleasant, especially towards
OL,11,Fthe coasts with strong northwesterly
OL,12,Fwinds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FTonight, there may be a few
OL,15,Flight showers around at first, turning
OL,16,Fdrier into the early hours with a few
OL,17,Fclearer spells developing and winds
OL,18,Feasing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
