OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA bright start for some on
OL,6,FMonday before cloud and rain move in
OL,7,Ffrom the southwest through the
OL,8,Fafternoon, sometimes heavy. Winds
OL,9,Fstrengthen, with coastal gales
OL,10,Fpossible by evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FRemaining chilly and unsettled.
OL,14,FBlustery, occasionally heavy showers
OL,15,Fon Tuesday and Wednesday with strong
OL,16,Fcoastal winds. Further rain arrives on
OL,17,FThursday with strong winds returning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
